+## Design decisions
+
+- Schema3 retains existing settings path and stable IDs. Parse records source
+  schema independent of order/comments. Migration requires an exact verified
+  original-schema backup; failed read/backup/replace preserves live/disk state.
+  Explicit reset backs up even invalid/future bytes. Recovery files are separate.
+- Session safety, identification, enabled flags and pause are authoritative.
+  Manual/sticky sessions retain captured assignment/timing/padding and bypass
+  automatic inhibitors. Current enabled/hardware safety caps still apply.
+- Snooze is monotonic, session-local and automatic-only. Expiry/resume starts
+  fresh idle; session pause is separate. Suspend retains remaining snooze or
+  expires it without catch-up activation.
+- Rules match Windows ordinal case-insensitive executable paths; explicit
+  name-only rules are less precise. Audio filtering precedes source aggregation;
+  unknown/ambiguous contributions are never guessed away.
+- Input0 system,1 legacy combined,2 pointer,3 foreground are distinct. Missing
+  attribution credits all. XInput uses optional installed system APIs, deadzones,
+  held/release semantics and bounded polling; stale enabled observations inhibit.
+- Dim precedes presentation timer origin. Original clock/sparse scenes cap frame
+  invalidation at10fps and stop it at black. Software opacity is not brightness.
+  Battery source changes never rewrite saved assignment or grant power authority.
+- Profile precedence: explicit manual, first app, first schedule, base. Automatic
+  changes debounce1s; equal effective policies never repeatedly reset idle.
+  Explicit selection/release applies even while Settings owns foreground.
+- Preview has its own resizable contained lifecycle, no controller/power node,
+  and120s limit. UI drafts are keyed by snapshotted stable IDs. Import targets
+  remain stable across topology changes and are revalidated before mapping.
+- Release authority is explicit nextbeta-v1, version1.1.0-beta.1, retained source
+  filename and ID, nextbeta/nextbeta-x64 outputs, exact16 checks and32 cases.
+  Rollback evidence binds pinned RC4 source/ZIP, actual compiler/runtimes,
+  current input/build identities, restored fixtures and output hashes.
