+Consult its README, `windhawk/docs/RELEASING.md` and adversarial review before edits.
+The parent `windhawk/` tree retains earlier development history and is not the
+authoritative latest public product. Do not distribute updates into that dirty
+tree implicitly. Parent `src/`, build entry points and root README remain the
